                      "texts": [
                        {
                          "tag": "p",
                          "value": "Why would you work at a startup in an economic downturn?"
                        },
                        {
                          "tag": "p",
                          "value": "Now is as good a time as any to start a startup – especially if you get into YC. But what about joining a startup in this economy? We’re obviously biased, but we think it’s a great time to join a startup too. Here are three reasons to consider."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
