                      "texts": [
                        {
                          "tag": "p",
                          "value": "Why would you start a startup in an economic downturn?"
                        },
                        {
                          "tag": "p",
                          "value": "In an economic downturn, there are obvious downsides of starting a startup — but there are also powerful upsides; because to survive, you have to *actually* build something people want."
                        }
