                          "tag": "p",
                          "value": "How to maintain engineering velocity as you scale"
                        },
                        {
                          "tag": "p",
                          "value": "Faire’s engineering team grew from five to over 100 engineers in three years. Throughout this growth, we were able to sustain our pace of engineering execution by adhering to four guiding principles."
